  <title>2.8.2 Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00498</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.8.2 Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>b4d24722-e5e7-419e-98d6-59abce62b06a</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">A zookeeper feeds the tigers a meal of rabbits and chickens. The average rabbit weighs 4 pounds, and the average chicken weighs 5 pounds. Each tiger must eat at least 15 pounds of meat per day.</para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
